  description: "When a Fusion Monster(s) is Fusion Summoned to your field (except
    during the Damage Step): You can target 1 of those monsters; apply these effects
    in sequence.\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 \"Lunalight Token\" (Beast-Warrior/DARK/Level
    4/ATK 2000/DEF 2000) to your opponent's field.\r\n\u25CF That target gains 500
    ATK for each monster your opponent controls (even if this card leaves the field).\r\nDuring
    your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY; send 1 card from your
    hand to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon 1 \"Lunalight\" monster from your
    Deck. You can only use this effect of \"Lunalight Serenade Dance\" once per turn."
